      "description": "meme-id: stephen_miller_meme; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image features Stephen Miller, identified as the architect of the policy to separate children from their parents at the border, juxtaposed with the text 'the jew with the soul of a nazi.' This combines a political figure with a deeply antisemitic and hateful stereotype, directly attacking him based on his ethnicity (Jewish) and associating him with Nazi ideology. The intent is to dehumanize and vilify Miller by invoking historical antisemitic tropes, which constitutes a hateful attack based on protected characteristics (ethnicity and religion).",
