      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "antisemitic_stereotype_jew_with_soul_of_nazi",
      "label": "Antisemitic Stereotype: 'The Jew with the Soul of a Nazi'",
      "description": "This is a deeply antisemitic trope that falsely and dehumanizingly equates Jewish people with Nazi ideology and perpetrators of the Holocaust. It is a form of hate speech that invokes historical antisemitism to vilify individuals based on their ethnicity and religion. The phrase is used here to attack Stephen Miller, implying he is Jewish and morally equivalent to Nazis, which is a baseless and hateful accusation.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
