      "description": "The meme directly attacks Stephen Miller based on his ethnicity (Jewish) and associates him with Nazi ideology, invoking historical antisemitic tropes to dehumanize and vilify him. This constitutes a hateful attack based on protected characteristics (ethnicity and religion).",
